  "prototypeNotes": [
    "This index is the canonical discovery surface for the complete Werewolf prototype.",
    "Chronicle loads the prototype entirely from package artifacts and never invokes Werewolf-specific registration code.",
    "The prototype remains nonauthoritative until reviewed artifacts are promoted into the package publication surface.",
    "Blocked optional capabilities remain visible without disabling the supported Character creation slice.",
    "The cleaned source summary supports guided extraction but is never treated as direct runtime authority.",
    "Chronicle owns discovery, contract validation, package isolation, diagnostics, fingerprints, and promotion boundaries.",
